# ============================================================================
# Docker 构建上下文排除项 —— 镜像构建只需少量文件(requirements/package.json/
# entrypoint)，其余大目录全部排除以加快上传。项目代码运行时通过 bind mount 提供。
# ============================================================================
.git
.claude
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.runtime
logs
data
tests
shared_claude
teamwork
super-agent-party
training data
assets/live2d
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo
.empty_model
.env

# GPT-SoVITS 体积庞大，构建期只需要它的 requirements.txt
GPT-SoVITS-v2-240821/*
!GPT-SoVITS-v2-240821/requirements.txt
